      "startSeconds": 1186.02,
      "endSeconds": 1196.14,
      "audiblePhrase": "Yes, that's one of the key criticisms of vertical farming. If the electricity comes from fossil fuels, the carbon footprint can actually be worse than conventional agriculture.",
