      "startSeconds": 1242.76,
      "endSeconds": 1258.88,
      "audiblePhrase": "I think urban farming is most viable as a complement to, rather than a replacement for, conventional agriculture. It can provide fresh produce locally and build community, but it can't feed entire cities.",
